&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Robotics and Mechatronics Teams at Agile Robots&lt;/strong&gt; are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;(Senior) Systems and Safety Engineer (m/f/d)&lt;/strong&gt;, who will own system-level engineering and functional safety for our robot. You&#39;ll decide whether a design is safe enough to ship, since missing a hazard here risks real injury.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
